Subject: [PATCH 07045/11362] [outer-loop] Task 8: exp5700 test suite +
 formatting (goal-predicate veto live-integration)

Adds tests/python/test_experiment_5700_goal_predicate_veto_live_integration.py
(7 tests: blocked-precondition path, inconclusive-no-real-levelup guard,
confirmed/did-not-fire verdict branches, and a real-artifact assertion test
against the checked-in result) and applies ruff format to the exp5700 module
and its test file.

The substantive exp5700 script + its real result artifact + the matching
REQ-ARC-WMTE-5593-3 spec.md LIVE-INTEGRATION EMPIRICAL FOLLOW-UP section were
already captured (byte-identical, verified via git diff) by a concurrent
conductor checkpoint commit (f45adf8ab) before this commit -- this commit adds
the test coverage that was still outstanding and formats the two files.

Real result (2026-07-14, live lp85 E3AgentPolicy episode, real GPU-backed
Qwen3.5-9B-MTP induction): veto-on arm rejected a real induced goal predicate
scoring goal_predicate_consistency_accuracy=0.021277 (1/47 real transitions
correct); veto-off arm on the SAME real transitions proceeded to planned=True
on an independently-induced, comparably-poor predicate. Confirms the veto
catches a genuine miscalibrated-predicate failure mode.

